/target
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock.orig

# Quarto tutorial build caches (rendered output goes to /target/tutorials)
.quarto/
/_freeze/
**/.jupyter_cache/

# Editor / OS cruft
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Third-party Verilog-A corpus (untracked scratch space, not part of the model zoo) and
# working notes. `syntax_guide.txt`/`tokens.txt` are personal notes compiled from the LRMs in
# /references/ (themselves ignored, above): useful while writing docs/token-reference.md, but
# derived from text that is not ours to redistribute, and superseded by that document as the
# tracked record.
/external/
/docs/notes.txt
/docs/syntax_guide.txt
/docs/tokens.txt

# Language reference manuals (VAMS-LRM-2-4.pdf, OVI_VerilogA.pdf, veriaref.pdf) — ~6 MB of
# third-party PDFs, kept locally because docs/token-reference.md and the T5 noise work are
# written against their normative text, but not ours to redistribute. Fetch your own copies
# into this directory; nothing in the build reads them.
/references/
